  "description": "A titanium front triangle featuring 3D-printed head tube, bottom bracket, and pivot junctions meets the proven carbon rear triangle and links of the Ranger V3. It’s a first-of-its-kind combination of materials, manufacturing, and engineering and we built it to showcase what’s possible when a decade of titanium experience meets everything we’ve learned about making the highest quality carbon bikes on the planet.\n\nThe Ranger Ti isn’t lighter, cheaper, or easier to make, and that’s kind of the point. This limited run brings together the quiet, damped ride quality that makes titanium so special with the lateral stiffness of a carbon rear triangle and our CBF suspension platform. The result takes the unmistakable Ranger ride that has earned fans around the world and adds an entirely new character. Incredibly composed, remarkably quiet, and hard to describe until you ride it. It may not make much sense on paper. On the trail, it makes a whole lot more.",
